vulnerabilities.suggested_fix:
Modify _incomingTokenBalance() to cap the computed lock amount by the user’s actual token balance:

```solidity
function _incomingTokenBalance() internal view override returns (uint256) {
    uint256 allowance = erc20Token.allowance(msg.sender, address(this));
    uint256 balance = erc20Token.balanceOf(msg.sender);
    return allowance >= balance ? balance : allowance;
}
```

Optionally, also consider requiring an explicit amount parameter for locking “all” to avoid relying on allowance semantics, or provide a dedicated helper that safely computes the max transferable amount.
